      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "Incomplete length validation. The function rejects only nonpositive replies, so a positive reply shorter than a DNS `HEADER` still reaches header parsing. The patch adds the missing `len_unsigned < sizeof (HEADER)` rejection immediately after this block."
